  "title": "Amazing Almond Flour Pancakes (Gluten-Free and Paleo-Friendly)",
  "description": "This recipe for almond flour pancakes is not only gluten-free and paleo-friendly, but it's delicious to boot! Top with maple syrup and fresh fruit.",
  "authors": [
